  "content": {
    "_note": "Deep content check (Phase 2.5). Phrase lists from docs/research/deep-content-research.pdf. Some table cells in that PDF are clipped (also in its embedded text), so lists use the visible text plus terms the research names elsewhere (Top 15 list). Phrases match case-insensitively with flexible spaces; patterns are JavaScript regex sources (flags gimu: ^ and $ match line starts/ends). evidence: official = KDP Help/Terms text, reported = author/news account, both = official rule + reported case.",
    "lastVerified": "2026-11-08",
    "snippetChars": 50,
    "sources": {
